<speak>Yes, I'm willing to accept investment losses and realise a loss on this sale if that helps me reduce my exposure and meet my spending needs. I'll put my pen down for a moment so I can listen without trying to do two things at once. That is probably another habit I need to improve. At work, I'm always making notes while somebody is still speaking, and sometimes I miss the transition to the next subject. For a personal conversation, I would rather give it my full attention and then write the administrative reminders afterwards.</speak>